.TH DANBY-MOVINGPIVOT 1
.SH NAME
danby-movingpivot \- simulate a vertically driven pendulum
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B movingpivot
.SH DESCRIPTION
The pivot oscillates vertically, periodically changing the effective gravity.
This is the standard parametrically excited pendulum and can exhibit resonance
or stabilization of otherwise unstable motion.
.PP
The plot shows angle and pivot height.  Click a parameter scale to change it,
space pauses, period steps while paused, R resets, and Q exits.
